      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8BA48BC60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你不会是因为它把长椅\n弄得黏糊糊的，所以在装傻吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0D4F1A662F56E04E3A5B83628A957F6905000A5F045F979ECF7CCA7CCA7684FF0C62404EE5572888C550BB5427FF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有点可疑啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670970B953EF7591554A3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我问你，\n你住在哪儿？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621195EE4F60FF0C000A4F604F4F572854EA513FFF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "翡绿区",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7FE17EFF533A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "旅馆Z",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65C59986005A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "无可奉告",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E053EF5949544A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "长期住在旅馆里？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "957F671F4F4F572865C5998691CCFF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太可疑了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A53EF75914E863002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "干什么工作的？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E724EC04E485DE54F5C7684FF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超Z队",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85005A961F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA登峰战",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041767B5CF062180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "无可奉告",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E053EF5949544A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是无业游民咯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F65E04E1A6E386C1154AF3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太可疑了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A53EF75914E863002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你根本就不是密阿雷的居民对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F606839672C5C314E0D662F5BC6963F96F776845C456C115BF95427FF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我在旅行",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211572865C5884C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "无可奉告",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E053EF5949544A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怪不得。\n听口音也不像是“密阿雷之子”。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "602A4E0D5F973002000A542C53E397F34E5F4E0D50CF662F201C5BC6963F96F74E4B5B50201D3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希望你能更配合一点。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E0C671B4F6080FD66F4914D54084E0070B93002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我再确认一次，\n这只黏黏宝不是你的宝可梦？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211518D786E8BA44E006B21FF0C000A8FD953EA9ECF9ECF5B9D4E0D662F4F6076845B9D53EF68A6FF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不认识",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8BA48BC60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "撒谎的下场是很严重的哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64928C0E76844E0B573A662F5F884E2591CD768454E63002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "黏黏～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9ECF9ECFFF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它明明不是你的宝可梦，\n怎么看起来跟你这么亲？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83660E660E4E0D662F4F6076845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A600E4E48770B8D7767658DDF4F608FD94E484EB2FF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果它不是你的宝可梦，\n那就把你的同行宝可梦给我看看。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C5B834E0D662F4F6076845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A90A35C31628A4F607684540C884C5B9D53EF68A67ED96211770B770B3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "知道我是什么意思吧？\n你要通过宝可梦对战来给我看。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "77E590536211662F4EC04E48610F601D5427FF1F000A4F608981901A8FC75B9D53EF68A65BF9621867657ED96211770B3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你这人……\n反抗得很激烈啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD94EBA20262026000A53CD62975F975F886FC070C8554A3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一开始就像这样\n乖乖服从就好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E005F0059CB5C3150CF8FD96837000A4E564E56670D4ECE5C31597D4E863002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "黏黏宝！\n你不能擅自跑远呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9ECF9ECF5B9DFF01000A4F604E0D80FD64C581EA8DD18FDC5440FF0100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "黏黏～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9ECF9ECFFF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还把长椅都弄脏了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8628A957F690590FD5F04810F4E862026202600100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来！黏黏宝！\n我把长椅弄干净了，回家吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF019ECF9ECF5B9DFF01000A6211628A957F69055F045E7251C04E86FF0C56DE5BB65427300200100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来那不是你的黏黏宝啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B676590A34E0D662F4F6076849ECF9ECF5B9D554A3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟密阿雷市里的\n野生宝可梦增加了嘛。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n为了防止麻烦发生，\n我们也增加了盘问。很抱歉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF5BC6963F96F75E0291CC7684000A91CE751F5B9D53EF68A6589E52A04E86561B300200100001BE01000A4E3A4E8696326B629EBB70E653D1751FFF0C000A62114EEC4E5F589E52A04E8676D895EE30025F8862B16B493002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了表示歉意，分享一个事给你吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n黏黏宝进化为最强样子的条件，\n似乎和下雨有关哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868868793A6B49610FFF0C52064EAB4E004E2A4E8B7ED94F605427300200100001BE01000A9ECF9ECF5B9D8FDB53164E3A67005F3A68375B50768467614EF6FF0C000A4F3C4E4E548C4E0B96E86709517354E63002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好了，感谢你的配合！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D4E86FF0C611F8C224F607684914D5408FF01001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
